    "Tier 1: DEGRADED PASS (skips: lint=no staged files)" under
    guards.allow_skips: false (CF-031). Committed with
    core.hooksPath=/dev/null; the guard battery runs through
    gitreins task complete CF-169-DOC1 against this commit.
    
